# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# UniVibe MVP — environment variables
#
# Demo mode (default): NO env file required. The app boots with SQLite at
# ./data.db and uses deterministic fallbacks for all AI features.
#
# To turn on real Gemini generation across onboarding, Campus Vibe narrative,
# Career Pathway generation, and Micro-skill lessons:
#   1. Copy this file to .env
#   2. Set GEMINI_API_KEY below
#   3. npm install   (the @google/generative-ai package is optional but already
#      listed in package.json, so this will just pick it up)
#   4. npm run dev
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# Optional — Gemini API key. Leave blank to use deterministic fallbacks.
# Get a key from https://aistudio.google.com/app/apikey
GEMINI_API_KEY=

# Optional — server port. Defaults to 5000.
# PORT=5000

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Future / not required for MVP
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Supabase (Auth + Realtime) is NOT required to run the MVP. The schema in
# shared/schema.ts and the routes in server/routes.ts are written so that
# swapping the demo auth + SQLite + polling for Supabase later is a flat
# replacement, not a rewrite. When you're ready:
#
# SUPABASE_URL=
# SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=
# SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY=
